# True Strength (bastok 53, MNK AF3): Ayame in Metalworks; the ??? (qm_truestrength) and Huu Xalmo the Savage in Castle
# Oztroja. This flow: the guard (The First Meeting completed, main job MNK, main level AF3_QUEST_LEVEL 50), the offer
# 748, and the Xalmo Feather to Ayame (GM-given here; the ??? part is #oztroja): 749, the reward. Default: Ayame 701.
# Ayame's other quests (Out of the Depths: Bastok fame level 3; Return to the Depths; Trust: Bastok) and missions need
# what this char lacks.
lists Metalworks/Ayame/onTrigger Metalworks/Ayame/onTrade Metalworks/onEventFinish/748 Metalworks/onEventFinish/749
char zone=Metalworks pos=133,-19,34 job=MNK lvl=50
quest Bastok.TheFirstMeeting accepted
item BoneChip
login
trigger Ayame                   # The First Meeting not completed: 701
finish
trade Ayame BoneChip x1         # available: no trade handler, nothing
quest Bastok.TheFirstMeeting completed
trigger Ayame                   # The First Meeting completed, MNK 50: 748
finish                          # accepted
trigger Ayame                   # accepted: no trigger handler, 701
finish
trade Ayame BoneChip x1         # accepted, not the feather: nil
item XalmoFeather
trade Ayame XalmoFeather x1     # 749
finish                          # completed: Temple Hose, Bastok fame +20, Paragon of Monk Excellence, the feather taken
trigger Ayame                   # completed: 701
finish
trade Ayame BoneChip x1         # completed: nothing
